                                         <li>\n                                    Professional and Qualified\n                            </li>\n                                                    <li>\n                                    Expert &amp; Professional Engineers\n                            </li>\n                                                    <li>\n                                    Fully Satisfaction Guarantee\n                            </li>\n                                            </ul>\n	            <h2>Sourcing the best of this projects</h2>				\n            		            		Some form, by injected humour, or randomised words which don\'t look even slightly believable. If you are going to use a passage of Lorem Ipsum, you need to be sure there isn\'t anything embarrassing hidden in the middle of text all the Lorem Ipsum generators.  \n		<ul>\n				  <li>\n				    <a href=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/portfolios/reliable-hands/\">\n				    	 Previous\n				    	 Reliable Hands\n					</a>\n				  </li>\n						</ul>\n	            Project Information				\n<p style=\"font-weight: 600;color: #071230;flex: 0 0 33%\">Category</p>\n:  Commercial, Factory\n<p style=\"font-weight: 600;flex: 0 0 33%;color: #071230\">Client</p>\n:  Daenerys Targaryen\n<p style=\"font-weight: 600;flex: 0 0 33%;color: #071230\">Start Time</p>\n:  6 June, 2023\n<p style=\"font-weight: 600;color: #071230;flex: 0 0 33%\">End Time</p>\n:  8 August, 2023\n<p style=\"font-weight: 600;color: #071230;flex: 0 0 33%\">Budget</p>\n:  $5000\n<p style=\"font-weight: 600;color: #071230;flex: 0 0 33%\">Website</p>\n:  www.fixhero.com\n<p style=\"font-weight: 600;color: #071230;flex: 0 0 33%\">Rating</p>\n:\n<p><img src=\"http://localhost/pintura1/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Star-1.png\" alt=\"image\" /></p>\n            <h3>Commercial Services</h3>\n        &#036;79Off-35%\n                        Discount\n    Capitalize on low hanging fruit to identify a ballpark value added activity  beta test override the digital divide with additional clickthroughs from DevOps.\n            <ul>\n                            <li>\n                </li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/contact-us/\">Request a Plumber                                                </a>\n    <p>Expire on: 02.06.2023</p>', 'Pro Handy', 'Painting the inside of residential or commercial buildings, including walls, ceilings, trim, and doors.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'pro-handy', '', '', '2026-11-12 15:26:33', '2026-11-12 15:26:33', '', 0, 'http://192.168.0.134:10011/?post_type=portfolios&#038;p=75599', 0, 'portfolios', '', 0),
