(78532, 1, '2023-09-07 10:25:14', '2023-09-07 10:25:14', '<h2>Painting </h2>				\n                                                <img src=\"http://localhost/pintura1/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/twisted-arrow-1.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n	            No.1 Painting Services<h1>Professional Painting Services</h1>				\n            		            		<p>Our vans are fitted with high pressure jetting units which will clear blocked drain safely, easily and professionally.</p>  \n								<a href=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/about/\" >\n						Read More											\n																		<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 11 12\"><path d=\"M10.8424 1.4038C10.8424 1.04482 10.5514 0.753804 10.1924 0.753803L4.34239 0.753804C3.9834 0.753803 3.69239 1.04482 3.69239 1.4038C3.69239 1.76279 3.9834 2.0538 4.34239 2.0538H9.54239V7.2538C9.54239 7.61279 9.8334 7.9038 10.1924 7.9038C10.5514 7.9038 10.8424 7.61279 10.8424 7.2538L10.8424 1.4038ZM1.45962 11.0558L10.652 1.86342L9.73277 0.944184L0.540381 10.1366L1.45962 11.0558Z\" fill=\"#6D6D6D\"></path></svg>																									</a>\n                                                <img src=\"http://localhost/pintura1/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/bnr-img1-1.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n				    						    			 20\n				    		K+				    	\n				    					    		Happy Clients	\n                                                <img src=\"http://localhost/pintura1/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/painter-vai-1.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n                        <img src=\"http://localhost/pintura1/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/feature-icon1-1.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n                    <h4  \n                   >\n                    <a href=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/services/\"  >\n                        Residential Painting                    </a>\n                    </h4>\n                lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibhti eusmod tincid laoreet dolore.            \n    