(80676, 1, '2023-06-08 10:48:49', '2023-06-08 10:48:49', '<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RIkbLLeh6bw\">\n				    			</a>\n	            Who We Are<h2>Committed to provide high quality painting services</h2>				\n            		            		<p>Painting services are offered by professional contractors or that specialize in various aspects of painting. These services canbe encompass a wide range of painting-related tasks.</p>  \n                        <img src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/arcitecture.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n                                    <h4> Professional &amp; Creative Staff </h4>\n                        <img src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/quality.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n                                    <h4> Warrantees &amp; Gurantees</h4>\n                Client Stisfaction\n                <p>\n                </p>\n								<a href=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/about/\" >\n						Read More											\n																		<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 11 12\"><path d=\"M10.8424 1.4038C10.8424 1.04482 10.5514 0.753804 10.1924 0.753803L4.34239 0.753804C3.9834 0.753803 3.69239 1.04482 3.69239 1.4038C3.69239 1.76279 3.9834 2.0538 4.34239 2.0538H9.54239V7.2538C9.54239 7.61279 9.8334 7.9038 10.1924 7.9038C10.5514 7.9038 10.8424 7.61279 10.8424 7.2538L10.8424 1.4038ZM1.45962 11.0558L10.652 1.86342L9.73277 0.944184L0.540381 10.1366L1.45962 11.0558Z\" fill=\"#6D6D6D\"></path></svg>																									</a>\n		<!-- Style 1 Start -->\n		            							 		            		<img src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/phone-call.png\" alt=\"Contact Title\" />\n			            					            		 Call us anytime\n				                <a href=\"tel:0318148965\">0318 148 965</a>\n	<!-- Style 1 End -->	\n                                                                             Expert . Painting . \n                                                                             Expert . Painting . \n	            Why Choose Us<h2>Some Reasons You Choose Us</h2>				\n            		            		We have been installing boilers and heating systems for over 10 year and are we are experts in this field have a team qualified.  \n                            <img src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/finish.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n                <h2  \n               >\n                <a href=\"#\"  >\n                    Faux Finishes                </a>\n                </h2>\n                Our customers are at the heart\n company and with problem the other hand denounce            \n				    						    			 125\n				    		+				    	\n				    					    		Team Members	\n				    						    			 12\n				    		K+				    	\n				    					    		Project Done	\n                            <img src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/painting.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n                <h2  \n               >\n                <a href=\"#\"  >\n                    Pre-Paint Demo                </a>\n                </h2>\n                Our customers are at the heart\n company and with problem the other hand denounce            \n                            <img src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/water.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n                <h2  \n               >\n                <a href=\"#\"  >\n                    Water Proofing                </a>\n                </h2>\n                Our customers are at the heart\n company and with problem the other hand denounce            \n				    						    			 10\n				    		+				    	\n				    					    		Award Winning	\n				    						    			 10\n				    		K+				    	\n				    					    		Happy Clients	\n                            <img src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/color-proffing.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n                <h2  \n               >\n                <a href=\"#\"  >\n                    Color Proof                </a>\n                </h2>\n                Our customers are at the heart\n company and with problem the other hand denounce            \n                                        <h3>\n                        Request A Service                     </h3>\n            <form data-form_id=\"5\" id=\"fluentform_5\" data-form_instance=\"ff_form_instance_5_1\" method=\"POST\" ><fieldset style=\"border: none!important;margin: 0!important;padding: 0!important;background-color: transparent!important;box-shadow: none!important;outline: none!important; min-inline-size: 100%;\">\n                    <legend style=\"display: block; margin: 0!important;padding: 0!important;height: 0!important;text-indent: -999999px;width: 0!important;overflow:hidden;\">Request Form</legend><input type=\'hidden\' name=\'__fluent_form_embded_post_id\' value=\'303\' /><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"_fluentform_5_fluentformnonce\" name=\"_fluentform_5_fluentformnonce\" value=\"0e625d8d50\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wp_http_referer\" value=\"/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php\" /><label for=\'ff_5_cus_names_first_name_\' aria-label=\"Full Name\">Full Name</label><input type=\"text\" name=\"cus_names[first_name]\" id=\"ff_5_cus_names_first_name_\" placeholder=\"Full Name\" aria-invalid=\"false\" aria-required=false><label for=\'ff_5_cus_email\' aria-label=\"Email Address\">Email Address</label><input type=\"email\" name=\"cus_email\" id=\"ff_5_cus_email\" placeholder=\"Email Address\" data-name=\"cus_email\"  aria-invalid=\"false\" aria-required=true><label for=\'ff_5_cus_phone\' aria-label=\"Phone Number\">Phone Number</label><input type=\"text\" name=\"cus_phone\" placeholder=\"Phone Number\" data-name=\"cus_phone\" id=\"ff_5_cus_phone\"  aria-invalid=\"false\" aria-required=true><label for=\'ff_5_cus_message\' aria-label=\"How can we help?\">How can we help?</label><textarea aria-invalid=\"false\" a