                                 <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 2\"><path d=\"M0 0V2H14V0H0Z\" fill=\"#071230\"></path></svg>\n                                                        We own and shape our future.\n                            <p>On the other hand we denounce with righteous indignat and dislike men who are so beguiled and demoralized by the charms of the moment.</p>                        \n	            Testimonials<h2>What Our Client reviews</h2>				\n                                                <img src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/quote-green.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n                                                                                    <p> Capitalize on low hanging fruit to identify a ballpark value added activity beta test override the digital divide with additional clickthroughs from DevOps. </p>\n                                                <img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team4.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team4.jpg 600w, https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team4-300x300.jpg 300w, https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team4-150x150.jpg 150w, https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team4-500x500.jpg 500w, https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team4-100x100.jpg 100w, https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team4-416x415.jpg 416w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />        \n                                                Tina Schaefer\n                                                                                                                                        Customer. (Fixhero)\n                                                <img src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/quote-green.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n                                                                                    <p> “Praesent sed rutrum purus, tincidunt blandit felis. Morbi euismod eros tellus, ac imperdiet ipsum posuere vitae. Nam vel condimentum dolor cras mauris leo varius id risus.” </p>\n                                                <img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team1.jpg 600w, https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team1-300x300.jpg 300w, https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team1-150x150.jpg 150w, https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team1-500x500.jpg 500w, https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team1-100x100.jpg 100w, https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team1-416x415.jpg 416w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />        \n                                                Hia Sintara\n                                                                                                                                        Customer. (Fixhero)\n                                                <img src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/quote-green.png\" alt=\"image\"/>\n                                                                                    <p> Capitalize on low hanging fruit to identify a ballpark value added activity beta test override the digital divide with additional clickthroughs from DevOps. </p>\n                                                <img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/team7.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://painting.fixherotheme.com/wp-conten